@startgost
title GOST Algorithm Diagram Sample

start

:Initialize variables;
:Read input data;

if (Input valid?) then (yes)
  :Process data;
  :Calculate result;
  while (More iterations?) is (yes)
    :Perform calculation;
    :Update values;
  endwhile (no)
  :Output result;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
endif

:Clean up resources;
stop

